Package: libupower-glib3
Version: @DEB_UPOWER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://upower.freedesktop.org/
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: UPower client library (libupower-glib)
 The libupower-glib client library for rootless iOS. gnome-shell imports
 gi://UPowerGlib in status/system.js at boot, so this library (and its on-device
 UPowerGlib-1.0 typelib) is required for the shell to start. The upower daemon is
 not built; battery data would come from an org.freedesktop.UPower daemon we do
 not ship, so the power indicator degrades to "no device".
